{"3844150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RippleIsland Kyle and Cal’s Restaurant", "steam_appid": 3844150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/eb9134c1d8b4257ac1abe5dc0a02c7d6.poster.avif?t=1778491604\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/eb9134c1d8b4257ac1abe5dc0a02c7d6.webm?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/eb9134c1d8b4257ac1abe5dc0a02c7d6.mp4?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripple Island: Kyle and Cal's Restaurant is a fast-paced cooperative cooking action game where up to 16 players work together to run an intensely busy restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook meals and serve customers… but that’s not all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients yourself through farming, fishing, and even raising pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of each character’s unique skills to turn the tide!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain power-up items and new cooking equipment to build a successful restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/e48c018c621f1a6b52c57e20268daf1c.poster.avif?t=1778491604\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/e48c018c621f1a6b52c57e20268daf1c.webm?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/e48c018c621f1a6b52c57e20268daf1c.mp4?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect total chaos where accidents turn into laughter in this wild cooperative multiplayer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready...get set...and <strong>Let’s Restaurant!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fully Featured Solo Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the story of the original Ripple Island, a beloved cult classic first released in 1988 in Japan, this mode offers a nostalgic yet freshly reimagined story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/da6e59c0ea9b93e3a74bf0d0ce261392.poster.avif?t=1778491604\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/da6e59c0ea9b93e3a74bf0d0ce261392.webm?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/da6e59c0ea9b93e3a74bf0d0ce261392.mp4?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cooking tournament is held to decide the best chef on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But just as the competition heats up, a dangerous threat crashes the party—!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kyle, a chef from the island, and Cal, a mysterious girl he meets along the way, set off on an adventure that takes them across the entire island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a heartfelt story filled with laughter and tears, alongside a challenging cooking game that puts both your brain and reflexes to the test.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>(Even if you can’t clear the game, you can still enjoy the full story—player-friendly level skip design included!)</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/eb9134c1d8b4257ac1abe5dc0a02c7d6.poster.avif?t=1778491604\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/eb9134c1d8b4257ac1abe5dc0a02c7d6.webm?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/eb9134c1d8b4257ac1abe5dc0a02c7d6.mp4?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripple Island: Kyle and Cal's Restaurant is a fast-paced cooperative cooking action game where up to 16 players work together to run an intensely busy restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook meals and serve customers… but that’s not all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients yourself through farming, fishing, and even raising pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of each character’s unique skills to turn the tide!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain power-up items and new cooking equipment to build a successful restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/e48c018c621f1a6b52c57e20268daf1c.poster.avif?t=1778491604\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/e48c018c621f1a6b52c57e20268daf1c.webm?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/e48c018c621f1a6b52c57e20268daf1c.mp4?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect total chaos where accidents turn into laughter in this wild cooperative multiplayer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready...get set...and <strong>Let’s Restaurant!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fully Featured Solo Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the story of the original Ripple Island, a beloved cult classic first released in 1988 in Japan, this mode offers a nostalgic yet freshly reimagined story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/da6e59c0ea9b93e3a74bf0d0ce261392.poster.avif?t=1778491604\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/da6e59c0ea9b93e3a74bf0d0ce261392.webm?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/extras/da6e59c0ea9b93e3a74bf0d0ce261392.mp4?t=1778491604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cooking tournament is held to decide the best chef on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But just as the competition heats up, a dangerous threat crashes the party—!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kyle, a chef from the island, and Cal, a mysterious girl he meets along the way, set off on an adventure that takes them across the entire island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a heartfelt story filled with laughter and tears, alongside a challenging cooking game that puts both your brain and reflexes to the test.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>(Even if you can’t clear the game, you can still enjoy the full story—player-friendly level skip design included!)</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The restaurant is packed and business is booming! Join forces with the quirky and wonderful animals of Ripple Island to cook and serve tons of tasty food!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/4689709ad5a9a22f6fff1cd090ea9fd74ad9f303/header.jpg?t=1778491604", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/5d734a0b5aca5db73899c6721aab21972ad53f10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778491604", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844150/5d734a0b5aca5db73899c6721aab21972ad53f10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778491604", "website": "https://sunsoft.games/rippleisland-restaurant/en/top", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 / 1060（3GB）以上、または AMD Radeon RX 580 / 6500 XT 以上（4GB VRAM）<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1920x1080 / 60fps を想定。最大16人プレイ時は有線接続推奨</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_re